  "solution": {
    "text": "Bond structure of molecules are:\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{HCl}=\\mathrm{H}^{+}-\\mathrm{Cl}^{-}$\r\n\r\n<img src=\"assets\\st0027_692529ab9e70.png\"><br>\r\n\r\nhence, clearly $\\mathrm{NH}_{4}^{+}$ ion contains all three types of bonds."
